WEBVTT

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:44.500
I'm very sorry, I haven't finished unpacking yet.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.370
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:50.640
No, no.  All that's left is the kitchen.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.470
I won't be seeing Koito-san anymore.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.230
Hi!  The front door was open so I let myself in.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.210
Huh?  Koito-san?

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.380
Where should I put my stole?

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:35.390
I'll take it!

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.970
Take my hat too, would you?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:40.840
Oh, it suits you.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.600
Koito-san...

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.130
That's me.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.020
It hasn't been that long since we saw each other.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.600
Did you forget your only friend's face already?

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.110
I certainly haven't forgotten yours.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.520
My, Shunka-sama.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.900
You got here so quickly.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.210
Tome-san, thanks for calling me.

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.990
Did you call her for me?

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.500
I'll bring you some tea.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.870
What's the matter?  Have a seat.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.260
I'm sorry.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.720
For what?

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.290
Well...

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.260
For everything.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.340
You're welcome.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:30.070
Still, when I woke up, I was inside of some gloomy cavern.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:31.690
I don't remember anything.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.470
Look!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.890
Your face is saying "Oh damn!"

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.390
You know everything, don't you?

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.740
So, what happened in there?

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:46.820
Will you not make a big deal of it if I tell you?

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.960
What?  A big deal?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.790
If there's trouble, bring it on!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.420
Twenty Faces showed up, huh?

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:58.500
So?  Did you tell him?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.820
Did you tell him?  That you love him?

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:02.490
Th-That's...

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.430
What?

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.430
You didn't tell him?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.950
I'd never say a thing like that.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.560
I know, I know.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.810
Though you won't tell me anything about Twenty Faces,

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.320
that face says it all.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.800
I've restrained myself from asking up until now.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.510
So...  Is he handsome?

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.990
It's not like that.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:27.870
What?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:28.580
He's ugly?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.180
He's wonderful!

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.120
Geez...

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.190
See, I knew.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.580
It's not like that.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.670
Such sad eyes.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.200
You've fallen in love, huh?

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:48.530
It's not like that!

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:50.720
It's fine, you don't have to hide it.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:51.670
Come on!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.680
Open up to me.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:04.730
Oh, my.  I used to play like that when I was a schoolgirl too.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.510
Tome-san, uhm...

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.950
It's fine.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.020
I understand.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.520
Where's yours, Tome-san?

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.410
I'll have mine in the kitchen.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.740
Oh no, have tea with us.

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:21.420
Yeah!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.760
Oh, you don't mind?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.130
Of course not!

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.640
OK, I'll bring my cup in here.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.640
Geez...

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.140
When she said...

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.640
...she played like that...

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.780
Well, to the reunion of the Detective Girls.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.680
Oh, my.  Detectives?

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.330
I used to read a lot of detective novels.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.170
Do you want to join our group?

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.430
May I?

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:02.420
I'd love to!

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.500
Then, one more time:

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.510
To us, the Detective Women.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.510
"Women"?

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.350
It's not just "Girls" anymore, eh?

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:30.030
At this time we have a special introduction to the members of the Detective Girls for your eyes only!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.880
Our first member is Mikamo Chizuko.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:36.560
She was raised by the famous Twenty Faces.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.100
Usually she's very reserved and quiet...

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:47.300
But get her mad and she'll send anyone
flying with her superhuman strength!

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:51.130
She's the Detective Girls' brute force specialist.

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:55.240
Our second member is the eldest member, Tome-san.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:57.590
She's the Detective Girls' sex appeal specialist.

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:09.620
With her ample, well-stacked bust, is there a man alive who can resist her charms?

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.990
There's no information that she can't gather.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.700
And then, there's me, Koito Shunka.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.370
The leader of the Detective Girls.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:27.050
With my extraordinary physical abilities and quick wits,

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:32.670
I've gathered everyone together in our daily battles for justice.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.720
Let's make that into a movie!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.030
What do you think?  It'd be great, wouldn't it?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.110
W-Well?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:08.360
For crying out loud.  Too stingy to provide me with a car.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.310
Is that it?

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:16.700
I wholeheartedly apologize for being unable to protect Chizuko-san that time and–

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.420
Save your apology.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:22.120
If you want to regain my trust, prove to me that you deserve it.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:24.720
I'm sure you can do something that simple, can't you?

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.980
Yes.  O-Of course.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.250
Kurosaki.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:30.480
Yes.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:37.990
We'd like you to recover an item like this one from young lady Chizuko's residence.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:40.740
Recover?

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:45.000
We'll be expecting it, Detective.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:49.900
All right, I've got to pull this off.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:52.910
It all depends on this.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:09:00.630
Akine should be arriving at the young lady's residence soon.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:03.020
Of course, ready our next move.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.040
Certainly, I'll make the preparations.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.020
Very good.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:15.880
Huh?  A tanuki figurine in a sweat-soaked
double-breasted suit is walking this way.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.780
Right?  He looks like one, doesn't he?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.920
It's rude to say something like that!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:30.430
Oh, but I wasn't talking about just anyone.

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:33.510
You knew who I meant when I said it was a tanuki figurine.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.540
See, no good.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.760
That's rude.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:40.460
Geez!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.300
But he does look like one.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:46.330
He might look like one, but don't say it out loud!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:52.520
Ah!  I'm so glad you're doing well.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:54.710
Here you are, Detective.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.400
Ah-ah, I'm in your debt.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:10:00.750
Ah!  I'm so glad you're doing well too, Tome-san.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.660
All right, I've lowered their defenses,
but there's an unexpected person here.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.670
And I'm so glad you haven't changed yourself.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:14.130
I never told Detective Akine where this place was.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.380
Could the Mistress have told him?

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:17.920
Not at all.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:29.220
Just like the story of the Bunbuku Chagama.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:32.760
Knock it off already!

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:33.970
Knock what off?

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.520
You shouldn't act that way.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.450
I'm glad you two are having a good time.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.490
That's true.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.520
Oh, right.  Akine-san.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:52.210
Wh-What is it?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:57.130
Tell us the story of how you saved Mikamo-san from Twenty Faces.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:59.310
Oh, wow!

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.970
You're interested in that?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:05.010
That's when I was dodging enemies on my right by weaving to my left.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:08.520
We were slamming our swords into each other, again and again!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:11.810
And then the train exploded!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:16.260
That couldn't daunt my courage and I slipped through and almost caught up with Twenty Faces.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:21.270
But frozen on the snow-covered field, Chizuko-kun...  Chizuko-kun...

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:31.500
So you see, I was right on the verge of cornering that scoundrel.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.540
What an incredible adventure.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:37.230
Well, certainly danger was my constant companion.

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:40.050
You'll have to excuse me, but I need...

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.690
It's right there after you leave the room.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.090
Pardon me.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.560
Hey, what did he come here for?

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.270
I wonder.

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:58.090
Man, this is going well so far.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.030
All right...

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.710
This is pretty shabby.

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:07.810
Maybe it's Tome's room.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:11.040
I can safely look around in here.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:18.640
This reminds me, that time when I was walking home holding Chieko's hand...

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:21.440
I didn't have any possessions either.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.730
Detective, what are you doing?

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:30.190
Well, I, uhm, just got lost...

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.270
What did the Mistress say to you?

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:35.480
N-No, it's not that...

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.290
I thought I heard someone in here.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.520
Don't lie to me!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.670
I really did!  Really!

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:43.060
You disgust me.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:45.450
I'm telling the truth.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:46.660
See!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.260
Tome-san!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:11.450
What's going on?

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.300
Which one?

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:15.380
The black-haired one.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:16.420
All right!

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:19.230
Young lady...

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:23.420
Don't try and fool us!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.390
It's a case!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.530
Y-Young lady...

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:45.930
Where'd she go?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.450
There!

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.520
Damn it!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.740
That hurt, bro.

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:58.810
Suck it up!

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.600
Hold it!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.190
Wait for me!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.240
Hey!  Hold it!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.730
Please stop!

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.050
Tome-san...

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.850
Let's use our secret weapons.

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:18.830
Excuse me?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.110
Circle around!

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.360
All right.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.350
OK, that's far enough.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:35.640
You're a real pain in the ass.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.690
Don't think badly of us for this.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.800
I'll be borrowing this.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.790
Shit!

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:05.920
D-Damn you!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.890
You little brat!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.740
Hold it right there, you evil-doers!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.870
Known by people far and wide!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.540
Now here right before your very eyes!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.620
The Beautiful Detective Girls have arrived!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.500
We're on our way, young lady!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.360
Idiot!  Get out of the way!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.530
Tome-san!  Koito-san!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.950
Ouch...

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.180
Are you all right?

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.370
I'll survive.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.750
Why would you go this far?

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.760
Freeze!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:37.640
D-D-Don't lay a hand on that girl!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.790
Splendid!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:06.120
Beautiful Detective Girls, our mission here is complete!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.020
They were probably hired by Mrs. Mikamo.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:24.980
They were going to kill that girl and pin it on me, who just came to steal a bottle.  Good riddance to them.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.930
Detective.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.600
Why did you save the young lady?

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.940
You even used a toy pistol.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:40.420
Do you remember when you were under
the control of that white-haired demon?

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.740
No, very, very little.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.880
Me neither.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:50.500
But, you know, in my confused mind,
I remember Twenty Faces disguised as Akechi.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.590
He was talking about the war.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:58.000
And he said that he was going to tend to his unfinished business.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.590
I don't know why he told that to me,

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:03.640
but when he said unfinished business from the war,

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.350
I thought about finding my lost sister.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.080
She might...

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.940
...have been Chizuko-kun.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.700
Of course, I know that Chizuko-kun isn't actually my little sister.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:24.220
But Twenty Faces' words and that white-haired demon's words got all mixed together.

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.230
Even now, I can't get them out of my head.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:32.960
So that's why I was so happy when I found Chizuko-kun on that island.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:38.340
Once I find my little sister, I'll finally begin to feel that the war is over.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.970
That's why I can't let Chizuko-kun get hurt.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.120
Hey, look at this.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.140
You're so silly, Koito-san.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.270
I guess I've got nothing to worry about.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.440
And now there are the Detective Girls, too.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.010
Detective.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.010
That's...

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.450
Please make good use of it.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:07.690
Next time please stay for dinner.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:14.420
But I guess the Beautiful Detective Girls passed their first test.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:17.800
Though somewhere along the way we became 'beautiful'.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.890
Isn't it all happening like I said it would?

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:24.620
My quick wit came up with the idea of using a vehicle, and Tome-san used her sex appeal.

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.460
And you used brute force!

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:27.650
Brute force?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:29.810
I didn't throw him by mere strength.

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:31.780
It's like I said:

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.730
Brains, sex, and strength.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.650
Geez.  Knock it off!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:39.190
Stop, that tickles!

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:49.960
Good work.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.730
I'll need to provide some extra compensation.

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:56.790
What does that mean?

00:19:56.790 --> 00:20:00.460
You let me discover that you were the one who procured this originally.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:06.150
I don't know how the law will feel about this, but what about the media?

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:08.450
It should make for some juicy gossip.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.180
How much do you want?

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.630
I'll take whatever you give me,

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:17.440
but I've already told this story to a reporter.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:21.040
It's still just some random rumor as of right now,

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.020
but if you don't want it to be a real news story,

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:25.720
you'll keep your hands off of Chizuko-kun.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.220
Kurosaki, show him out.

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:35.640
This family will have nothing to do with you from this point forward.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:38.060
The same can be said for the girl.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.210
Ma'am...

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:47.720
She still hates me, doesn't she?

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:50.430
Chizuko-kun is a good girl.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.010
Rather than hate,

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.850
she pities you.
